              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na wakuu wote, na watu wote, wakati, waliofanya agano hilo, ya kwamba kila mtu amweke huru mtumwa wake na mjakazi wake, mtu yeyote asiwatumikishe tena; wakatii, wakawaacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
